<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #F8FAFC; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #F8FAFC; padding-bottom: 60px; padding-top: 60px; }
        .main { background-color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; border-spacing: 0; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #bdbdbd; }
        .header { padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; }
        .content { padding: 0 50px 40px 50px; text-align: left; }
        .icon-container { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .icon-circle { width: 70px; height: 70px; background-color: #C90000; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; text-align: center; line-height: 70px; }
        h1 { color: #111111; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; }
        p { color: #64748B; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-weight: 500; }
        .closure-box { background-color: #FAFAFA; border-left: 4px solid #C90000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .closure-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
        .closure-text { color: #475569; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
        .original-box { background-color: #FAFAFA; border: 1px solid #F1F5F9; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 30px; }
        .original-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #94A3B8; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
        .original-text { color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .footer { padding: 30px 50px; text-align: center; background-color: #FDFDFD; border-top: 1px solid #F1F5F9; }
        .footer-text { color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <center class="wrapper">
        <table class="main" width="100%">
            <tr>
                <td class="header">
                    <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Mototrad" width="140" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto;">
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="content">
                    <div class="icon-container">
                        <div class="icon-circle">
                            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/ios-filled/35/ffffff/checkmark.png" style="vertical-align: middle; padding-top: 17px;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h1>Ticket Resolved</h1>
                    <p>Dear {{userName}},</p>
                    
                    <div class="closure-box">
                        <div class="closure-title">Status: Closed / Resolved</div>
                        <p class="closure-text">
                            Your support inquiry regarding <strong>"{{subject}}"</strong> has been marked as resolved and closed by the Mototrad support division.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <p>Thank you for contacting Mototrad support. If you believe this ticket was closed in error, or if you still require further support, you can submit a new request or contact us directly.</p>

                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #111111; font-weight: 800; margin: 30px 0 5px 0;">Best regards,</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #C90000; font-weight: 800; margin: 0;">The Mototrad Team</p>

                    <div class="original-box">
                        <div class="original-title">Your Original Message</div>
                        <p class="original-text">{{originalMessage}}</p>
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="footer">
                    <p class="footer-text">&copy; {{year}} Mototrad Marketplace. All rights reserved.</p>
                    <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 5px;">Dubai, United Arab Emirates</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </center>
</body>
</html>
